:: Deadwood Reblooms Trinity Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-trinity-contact'>>
  <<set $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.contact to 'pending'>>
  <<stress 6>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You continue praying. Another voice joins yours, speaking the same words a little ahead of you. You turn, but the cushions beside you are empty. <span class='deadwood-trinity'>You feel a presence.</span>
      <br><br>
      Light catches in the incense. Glowing spheres crowd the high windows, their surfaces shifting through each other. Between them, you see the chamber door opening. You watch yourself enter, kneel and leave. The figures move together. Your knees ache against the cushion.
      <br><br>
      Something brushes your thoughts as it passes. <span class='gold'>A warmth you thought lost returns.</span> <span class='black'>The hollow within you stirs.</span> <span class='purple'>Unbidden desires crowd your mind.</span> You clutch your pendant. What you can see is only a small part of something much larger, and even that is too much.<<gstress>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你继续祈祷。另一个声音跟着你念，始终比你快上几个字。你转过头，身旁的软垫却空着。<span class='deadwood-trinity'>你感觉到一种存在。</span>
      <br><br>
      熏香中透出微光。发亮的球体挤满高窗，球面不断穿过彼此。在它们之间，祈祷室的门开了。你看见自己进门、跪下，又起身离开。几个身影同时动着，你的膝盖却仍压在软垫上，隐隐发疼。
      <br><br>
      有东西经过，轻轻擦过你的思绪。<span class='gold'>早已失去的温暖重新涌来。</span><span class='black'>体内的空洞随之颤动。</span><span class='purple'>不请自来的欲念挤进脑海。</span>你攥住吊坠。眼前只是某种庞然大物的一小部分，你却已经承受不住。<<gstress>>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>

  <<lanLink ['Embrace', '放开心神，拥抱这一切'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Trinity Embrace'>><</lanLink>><<willpowerdifficulty 800 1400>>
  <<set $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.contactHeld to $willpowerSuccess is 1>>
  <br>
  <<lanLink ['Snap out of it', '摆脱这种感觉'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Trinity Snap'>><</lanLink>>
  <br>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Trinity Embrace

<<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<set _trinityUnlocked to false>>
<<if $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.contact is 'pending'>>
  <<if $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.contactHeld>>
    <<set $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.trinity to true>>
    <<set $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.contact to 'success'>>
    <<set _trinityUnlocked to true>>
    <<stress 18>><<trauma 12>><<awareness 12>><<pain 6>>
  <<else>>
    <<set $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.contact to 'failure'>>
    <<stress 36>><<trauma 36>><<awareness 6>><<control -25>><<pain 12>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>

<<if $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.contact is 'success'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You let the feeling in. The other voice falls silent. You hear yourself praying at the door, on the cushion, somewhere far beneath the temple. You cannot tell which words are coming from your mouth.
      <br><br>
      You dig your nails into the cushion's seam. Your head throbs. You keep your fingers there, concentrating on the rough thread until the voices fade. <span class='green'>You hold on.</span><<ggstress>><<ggtrauma>><<gpain>><<ggawareness>>
      <br><br>
      <span class='gold'>The warmth lingers along your spine.</span> <span class='black'>You can still feel the hollow beneath it.</span> <span class='purple'>Your thoughts stray to things you would never say here.</span> You flinch, expecting the warmth to burn away. It stays.
      <br><br>
      The spheres slip out of sight. A wisp of incense curls past your face. You sit shaking on the cushion for a while, then try the first words of your prayer. This time, you hear only your own voice.
      <<if _trinityUnlocked>>
        <br><br><i class='deadwood-trinity'>You have gained Trinity.</i>
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你放开心神。另一个声音停了。你听见自己在门边祈祷，在软垫上祈祷，又在神殿下方某个遥远的地方祈祷。你分不清哪一句是从自己嘴里念出来的。
      <br><br>
      你将指甲掐进软垫的接缝。头痛得发胀，你不肯松手，只顾着留意指尖粗糙的缝线，直到那些声音渐渐消失。<span class='green'>你撑住了。</span><<ggstress>><<ggtrauma>><<gpain>><<ggawareness>>
      <br><br>
      <span class='gold'>温暖仍沿着脊背流淌。</span><span class='black'>你依然能感觉到下面的空洞。</span><span class='purple'>脑中闪过一些绝不能在这里说出口的念头。</span>你一阵紧张，以为那股温暖就要消失。它却留了下来。
      <br><br>
      球体移出了视野，一缕熏香从面前飘过。你在软垫上发着抖，过了好一会儿，才试着重新念出祈祷的开头。这次，你只听见自己的声音。
      <<if _trinityUnlocked>>
        <br><br><i class='deadwood-trinity'>你获得了“三位一体”。</i>
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
<<elseif $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.contact is 'failure'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You let the feeling in. The voices grow louder. You try to stop praying, but they continue. Your hand is on the door, on the cushion, over your pendant. You cannot feel which one is yours.
      <br><br>
      You scream. The sound comes back from every direction, each cry starting before the last has left your throat. <span class='red'>You cannot hold on.</span> The chamber disappears.<<gggstress>><<gggtrauma>><<ggpain>><<lcontrol>><<gawareness>>
      <br><br>
      You come to curled on the cushion. Your throat is raw and your fingers hurt. The torches are still burning. Nothing moves beyond the windows. You cover your mouth, afraid another cry will come out.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你放开心神。那些声音越来越响。你想停下祈祷，它们却还在念。你的手按在门上，按在软垫上，又盖着吊坠。你分不清哪一只才是自己的。
      <br><br>
      你尖叫起来。声音从四面八方传回来，上一声还没离开喉咙，下一声便已经响起。<span class='red'>你撑不住了。</span>祈祷室从眼前消失。<<gggstress>><<gggtrauma>><<ggpain>><<lcontrol>><<gawareness>>
      <br><br>
      回过神时，你正蜷在软垫上。喉咙火辣辣地疼，手指也疼。火把仍在燃烧，窗外已经没有动静。你捂住嘴，生怕又有一声尖叫漏出来。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<prayerend>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Trinity Snap

<<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<if $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.contact is 'pending'>>
  <<set $VanillaPlus.divineTransformations.contact to 'escape'>>
  <<stress 6>><<awareness 3>><<willpower 3>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You shake your head and grip the cushion's edge. You concentrate on the incense in your nose and the cloth against your legs.
    <br><br>
    The chamber comes back into focus. The feeling has passed. You try to continue your prayer, but cannot find the next word.<<gstress>><<gawareness>><<ggwillpower>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你摇摇头，抓住软垫边缘，努力留意鼻间的熏香与腿上布料的触感。
    <br><br>
    祈祷室重新变得清楚。那股感觉已经过去。你想继续祈祷，却记不起下一个词。<<gstress>><<gawareness>><<ggwillpower>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<prayerend>>
